  "notes": "Duplex LC connector. Type 2B QSFP-DD package. Dimensions 18.35 mm x 93.26 mm x 8.50 mm. TX VOA inside with 4dB attenuation window. For OIF 400ZR app code 0x02 frequency fixed at 193.7THz and not configurable; transmit output power not configurable for 0x02. Transmission distance 400G OIF 400ZR app code 0x02 stated as 30~40 (unit km implied by other rows). Rx sensitivity -20 dBm at Inband OSNR ≥34dB for app code 0x02; -22 dBm 400ZR+ point to point. Input power range min -12 dBm (400G) with OSNR>26dB (400ZR) or OSNR>24dB (400ZR+). OSNR Tolerance 400ZR+ measured back-to-back with short optical channel. CD tolerance 400ZR: ≤0.5 dB penalty to OSNR sensitivity when change in SOP ≤1rad/ms. DGD 400ZR: OSNR penalty＜0.5dB. Peak PDL ≤1.3dB or ≤1.8dB additional OSNR penalty per table notes. Tolerance to change in SOP 50 krad/s with ≤0.5 dB additional OSNR penalty. 200G/100G CAUI-4 modes Note2: not tested in standard PN. Power Note1: 4×100GbE typical 22W max 23W. CFEC NCG 10.8dB; OFEC NCG 11.6dB theoretical max pre-FEC BER 2.0E-2.",
